{"3967260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Hog Fixer", "steam_appid": 3967260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hog Fixer is a roguelite where you play as a “HOG”: a highly skilled, humanoid pig mechanic. HOGs have always been bottom-of-the-barrel workers, taking on the dirtiest, most dangerous jobs no one else would touch. And in this world, fixing colossi is the worst of them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/013bc3925d65e7075731ed4e57a1c1fd.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/013bc3925d65e7075731ed4e57a1c1fd.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/013bc3925d65e7075731ed4e57a1c1fd.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRESS THE BUZZER. OPEN SESAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round starts the same way: press the buzzer. A Colossus rolls into your garage, and your first job is its DIAGNOSIS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the Big Screen to see what’s wrong: missing screws, weakened armor, drained batteries, even entire limbs gone. Find the issues. Find a way to fix them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9968a84f2f4b5f4bd204428ca82243f7.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9968a84f2f4b5f4bd204428ca82243f7.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9968a84f2f4b5f4bd204428ca82243f7.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A GARAGE FILLED WITH DANGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mechs aren’t just broken… they’re hazardous. You’ll have to deal with fires, toxic fumes, electrical surges, and unstable chemicals while you work. The Colossi are unpredictable, and one wrong move could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/ac899e0b8cdb46b97f7aba726d93af7e.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/ac899e0b8cdb46b97f7aba726d93af7e.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/ac899e0b8cdb46b97f7aba726d93af7e.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNEXPECTED VISITORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not entirely alone. After pressing the buzzer, you might get a visitor, or as we call it, an <strong>EVENT</strong>. A mysterious chest with new tools? A high-stakes slot machine? A gaming chair? Something helpful… or something disastrous? Every round is a gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/b73b4b770fec5f65189aee6ce112cec1.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/b73b4b770fec5f65189aee6ce112cec1.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/b73b4b770fec5f65189aee6ce112cec1.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABSURD TOOLS, SERIOUS JOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t always get the best equipment! You get whatever’s lying around: an electric guitar, a handmade screw gun, a katana, or even a janky old computer from Banana Inc… and that’s just the beginning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s a wide arsenal of bizarre and unexpected tools waiting to be discovered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9a9b7b34e1aa532b5574abd8fd2f5e09.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9a9b7b34e1aa532b5574abd8fd2f5e09.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9a9b7b34e1aa532b5574abd8fd2f5e09.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions, don’t hesitate to contact me: <a href=\"mailto:charlessorkinpro@gmail.com\">charlessorkinpro@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hog Fixer is a roguelite where you play as a “HOG”: a highly skilled, humanoid pig mechanic. HOGs have always been bottom-of-the-barrel workers, taking on the dirtiest, most dangerous jobs no one else would touch. And in this world, fixing colossi is the worst of them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/013bc3925d65e7075731ed4e57a1c1fd.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/013bc3925d65e7075731ed4e57a1c1fd.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/013bc3925d65e7075731ed4e57a1c1fd.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRESS THE BUZZER. OPEN SESAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round starts the same way: press the buzzer. A Colossus rolls into your garage, and your first job is its DIAGNOSIS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the Big Screen to see what’s wrong: missing screws, weakened armor, drained batteries, even entire limbs gone. Find the issues. Find a way to fix them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9968a84f2f4b5f4bd204428ca82243f7.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9968a84f2f4b5f4bd204428ca82243f7.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9968a84f2f4b5f4bd204428ca82243f7.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A GARAGE FILLED WITH DANGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mechs aren’t just broken… they’re hazardous. You’ll have to deal with fires, toxic fumes, electrical surges, and unstable chemicals while you work. The Colossi are unpredictable, and one wrong move could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/ac899e0b8cdb46b97f7aba726d93af7e.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/ac899e0b8cdb46b97f7aba726d93af7e.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/ac899e0b8cdb46b97f7aba726d93af7e.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNEXPECTED VISITORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not entirely alone. After pressing the buzzer, you might get a visitor, or as we call it, an <strong>EVENT</strong>. A mysterious chest with new tools? A high-stakes slot machine? A gaming chair? Something helpful… or something disastrous? Every round is a gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/b73b4b770fec5f65189aee6ce112cec1.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/b73b4b770fec5f65189aee6ce112cec1.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/b73b4b770fec5f65189aee6ce112cec1.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABSURD TOOLS, SERIOUS JOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t always get the best equipment! You get whatever’s lying around: an electric guitar, a handmade screw gun, a katana, or even a janky old computer from Banana Inc… and that’s just the beginning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s a wide arsenal of bizarre and unexpected tools waiting to be discovered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9a9b7b34e1aa532b5574abd8fd2f5e09.poster.avif?t=1772654764\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9a9b7b34e1aa532b5574abd8fd2f5e09.webm?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/9a9b7b34e1aa532b5574abd8fd2f5e09.mp4?t=1772654764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/extras/d795b88c5e64da7fd271479e651d0d3f.avif?t=1772654764\" width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions, don’t hesitate to contact me: <a href=\"mailto:charlessorkinpro@gmail.com\">charlessorkinpro@gmail.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are a HOG FIXER. A hog specialized in fixing giant mechs called 'Colossi.' You find yourself in a prison, and the warden offers you a deal: fix his Colossi and you’ll be a free hog. The issue? You don’t get the best equipment, Collosi are deathtraps, and every repair can turn into your last.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/63d17235d8fe96f7b852edf2795c1bc66df90d4e/header.jpg?t=1772654764", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/1ad96b96becf002afc3feaf22a2fbb173f10e04d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772654764", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/1ad96b96becf002afc3feaf22a2fbb173f10e04d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772654764", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  2GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  2.5GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Charles Sorkin"], "publishers": ["Charles Sorkin"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967260/